# Wave 43 §A — W15: a planeswalker's loyalty should show the way a creature's
# P/T does, and update when it changes. Seat 0 (human) controls Elspeth, Sun's
# Champion at loyalty 2 (`|Counters:LOYALTY=2` — explicit, not left to
# whatever ETB setup the engine does on its own; `GameState.
# applyCountersToGameEntity` sets this exactly, which is the deterministic
# number the spec asserts against), an uncontested turn-1 Main Phase 1. At
# loyalty 2 her OTHER two abilities (-3, -7 — `elspeth_suns_champion.txt`)
# cost more than she has, so +1 ("Create three 1/1 white Soldier creature
# tokens", no target) is the only one Forge offers: one click, no ability
# picker to navigate, and loyalty rises from 2 to 3 — the smallest real
# activation that proves the number on the board changes with it.
turn=1
activeplayer=human
activephase=MAIN1
humanlife=20
ailife=20
humanhand=
humanbattlefield=Elspeth, Sun's Champion|Counters:LOYALTY=2
humanlibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
humangraveyard=
aihand=
aibattlefield=
ailibrary=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
aigraveyard=
